{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">SAMUKID is the story of a child traveling with a blind companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become the protagonist of a legendary journey with your eccentric yet strong partner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/732483b75e27db42f170b3ca69e8d9e7.avif?t=1760365774\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/de1476de9c0e0d614cb48af5ae8a0cf1.poster.avif?t=1760365774\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/de1476de9c0e0d614cb48af5ae8a0cf1.webm?t=1760365774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/de1476de9c0e0d614cb48af5ae8a0cf1.mp4?t=1760365774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your blind companion handles the battles, while you, small and agile, take charge of movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sometimes you must pull your ally away from danger to survive, and other times push them into the heart of enemies to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategic positioning of allies and foes can also maximize your skill effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/93c77fbc6801555fb5a6433c16d599a5.avif?t=1760365774\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/980a201170de2e26268c6b58856715f2.poster.avif?t=1760365774\" width=960 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/980a201170de2e26268c6b58856715f2.webm?t=1760365774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/980a201170de2e26268c6b58856715f2.mp4?t=1760365774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeat monsters to earn loot and gold, then build your skill and loot decks to unleash powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trade for essential items or recruit mighty allies through special events to strengthen your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine skills, loot, and companions to craft your own strategies and experience fresh battles each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With the perfect synergy, you might even crush bosses with overwhelming power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/4d9711f81b1daab7f1987622bd0cb796.avif?t=1760365774\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/d1c3d2f67de93231c9a9659cf3b27f73.poster.avif?t=1760365774\" width=996 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/d1c3d2f67de93231c9a9659cf3b27f73.webm?t=1760365774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/d1c3d2f67de93231c9a9659cf3b27f73.mp4?t=1760365774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as unique characters such as a balanced samurai or a powerful but slow sorcerer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Different bosses and regions await, each demanding new tactics depending on their combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Challenge new builds with every run and enjoy your own distinctive combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876950?t=1760365774","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876950?t=1760365774","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/3b72cb5453da7bd72dba96cfbc53d79ad4a017e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760365774","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/3b72cb5453da7bd72dba96cfbc53d79ad4a017e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760365774","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3917540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">SAMUKID is the story of a child traveling with a blind companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become the protagonist of a legendary journey with your eccentric yet strong partner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/732483b7